                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The food court next to National Taiwan University of Science and Technology has a variety of dining options on the first and second floors. Seating is in the center area. Please recycle your plates after your meal. Each restaurant has marked recycling bins.\nThe Higetsu Beef Donburi is quite good. The only downside is that it doesn\u0027t come with any vegetables. I didn\u0027t realize it was my first time ordering, so I didn\u0027t order any side dishes. You can choose a drink or soup with your meal.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "台科大旁邊的美食區域. 一，二樓有很多不同的餐飲. 座位在中間區域. 餐後自行回收餐盤. 各店家會有標明的回收盒.\n日月見牛肉丼飯口味還不錯. 美中不足是完全沒有青菜. 第一次點也不知道. 所以沒有另外點小菜. 餐點可以選飲料或者湯.",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
